- op: discuss  # a3af
  at: '2026-07-30T16:48:24Z'  # a3af
  by: agent  # a3af
  actor: jgstern_agent  # a3af
  clock: 4  # a3af
  nonce: a3af  # a3af
  message: "DONE — same root cause and same PR as WI-zisig (see its closure note). meta.channel is registered on the edge axis and emitted on 145 self-corpus edges but was absent from docs/schema.json, because the schema hand-listed 2 of 32 edge-axis keys. Both meta blocks now derive their properties from the axis_meta_keys registry, so channel is documented (Edge.meta 2 -> 34 keys) along with every other registered key, and a ratchet fails if a registered key is missing. The spec half of the item is unchanged by this PR: channel's semantics are already documented via its MetaKeySpec description, which is now what the schema renders."  # a3af
